    "detailed_description": "Join George on the most unusual and mysterious journey of all in &quot;The Book of Death for Dummies&quot;!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf34 Get ready for... DEADLY vacations! \ud83c\udf34<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeath has taken a well-deserved vacation in Cancun and left George in charge! He'll have to learn to deal with Destiny and decide who should continue their journey in the land of the living. But beware, wrong choices lead to undesirable consequences!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Explore, investigate, and determine people's fates! \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Use your detective skills to gather clues, sift through personal information, and unveil dark secrets.<br />\r\n- Stay calm, get to know the suspects, their stories, and relationships to make informed decisions, but be careful not to let time run out, eh?!<br />\r\n- Consult the mysterious Book of Death and decide who deserves a one-way ticket to Belize, if you catch my drift...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2696\ufe0f Judge wisely, for lives are at stake! \u2696\ufe0f<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Make tough moral choices and take responsibility for the consequences.<br />\r\n- Avoid fatal errors, as a mere slip-up can trigger a colossal catastrophe.<br />\r\n- Unravel the enigmas of Destiny and prove you have what it takes to step into Death's shoes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the most thrilling and intriguing adventure of your life? Play &quot;The Book of Death for Dummies&quot; now and discover if George is up to the deadly challenge that awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Join George on the most unusual and mysterious journey of all in &quot;The Book of Death for Dummies&quot;!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf34 Get ready for... DEADLY vacations! \ud83c\udf34<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeath has taken a well-deserved vacation in Cancun and left George in charge! He'll have to learn to deal with Destiny and decide who should continue their journey in the land of the living. But beware, wrong choices lead to undesirable consequences!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Explore, investigate, and determine people's fates! \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Use your detective skills to gather clues, sift through personal information, and unveil dark secrets.<br />\r\n- Stay calm, get to know the suspects, their stories, and relationships to make informed decisions, but be careful not to let time run out, eh?!<br />\r\n- Consult the mysterious Book of Death and decide who deserves a one-way ticket to Belize, if you catch my drift...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2696\ufe0f Judge wisely, for lives are at stake! \u2696\ufe0f<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Make tough moral choices and take responsibility for the consequences.<br />\r\n- Avoid fatal errors, as a mere slip-up can trigger a colossal catastrophe.<br />\r\n- Unravel the enigmas of Destiny and prove you have what it takes to step into Death's shoes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the most thrilling and intriguing adventure of your life? Play &quot;The Book of Death for Dummies&quot; now and discover if George is up to the deadly challenge that awaits!",
    "short_description": "Death has taken a well-deserved vacation in Cancun and left George in charge! He'll have to learn to deal with Destiny and decide who should continue their journey in the land of the living. But beware, wrong choices lead to undesirable consequences!",
